# kin/child/head/brow_soft: the child's soft brows: under the fringe (none drawn on the Short cut)
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to KIN-CHILD in wave 2). The child, 21 px (STYLE_P2 3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body child
role brow soft
layer face
anchor head
keys rest
tags overlay

view D key rest origin 0 0
|.

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin 0 0
|.

view L key rest origin 0 0
|.
